### Smoke-test the API (VS Code "REST Client" extension). Change @base to http://localhost:5080 for local.
@base = https://api-production-11c6f.up.railway.app

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Register (copy the token from the response into @token below)
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "phone": "+971551110002", "name": "Test Resident", "password": "SmokeTest!234" }

###
@token = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### Communities
GET {{base}}/communities
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Link a lease (needs SELF_SERVE_LEASE=true)
POST {{base}}/me/leases
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "communityId": "PASTE_COMMUNITY_ID", "unit": "1204" }

### My bookings
GET {{base}}/bookings/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
